3
00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:15.623
Unit seven: Personal Identity & Media. Today you will use causative verbs 'make' and 'let'.

4
00:00:15.923 --> 00:00:18.482
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:19.433 --> 00:00:23.014
