18
00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:07.730
Teenage years are key for identity formation.

19
00:01:08.317 --> 00:01:11.410
Your turn. Say: Identity formation.

20
00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:15.848
Identity formation.

21
00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:17.886
Curated image.

22
00:01:18.883 --> 00:01:22.241
Curated image means a carefully chosen picture of your life.

23
00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:25.326
Her profile shows a curated image.

24
00:01:25.917 --> 00:01:28.499
Your turn. Say: Curated image.

25
00:01:31.333 --> 00:01:32.532
Curated image.

26
00:01:33.283 --> 00:01:34.807
Comparison culture.

27
00:01:35.817 --> 00:01:39.488
Comparison culture means always comparing yourself with others.

28
