44
00:02:33.617 --> 00:02:36.339
Your turn. Say: Digital persona.

45
00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.457
Digital persona.

46
00:02:41.217 --> 00:02:42.694
Self-image pressure.

47
00:02:43.683 --> 00:02:46.681
Self-image pressure means stress about how you look.

48
00:02:47.283 --> 00:02:49.829
Self-image pressure is common among teens.

49
00:02:50.417 --> 00:02:53.487
Your turn. Say: Self-image pressure.

50
00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:58.820
Self-image pressure.

51
00:02:59.583 --> 00:03:00.631
Body image.

52
00:03:01.617 --> 00:03:04.382
Body image means how you feel about your body.

53
00:03:04.983 --> 00:03:07.145
A positive body image is healthy.

54
00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.635
Your turn. Say: Body image.

55
00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.524
Body image.

56
00:03:15.283 --> 00:03:17.016
Validation-seeking.

57
00:03:18.017 --> 00:03:20.991
Validation-seeking means wanting approval from others.

58
00:03:21.583 --> 00:03:23.978
